1
00:00:01,439 --> 00:00:04,244
Durian

2
00:00:06,032 --> 00:00:12,449
Durian is a precious fruit of Southern region.

3
00:00:14,361 --> 00:00:23,138
Its flavor is extremely special, strong smell, spreads far.

4
00:00:24,796 --> 00:00:32,566
Durian smells like ripe jackfruit mixed with pomelo scent.

5
00:00:34,404 --> 00:00:41,425
Its flavor is charmingly strange

6
00:00:43,094 --> 00:00:50,144
Durian flowers bloom at end of year.

7
00:00:51,447 --> 00:01:01,766
Wind carries pleasant fragrance like betel nut,

8
00:01:03,976 --> 00:01:10,922
pomelo scent spreads throughout garden.

9
00:01:12,458 --> 00:01:18,385
Flowers bloom in clusters, ivory white color.

10
00:01:20,178 --> 00:01:30,428
Small petals like fish scales, similar to young lotus petals.

11
00:01:32,271 --> 00:01:37,482
Each flower stalk produces one fruit.

12
00:01:38,348 --> 00:01:47,667
Looking at durian fruit hanging under branch looks like ant nest.

13
00:01:49,483 --> 00:01:56,357
Fruit season comes in April, May.

14
00:01:58,131 --> 00:02:04,960
Standing looking at durian tree, I keep thinking about this strange tree shape.

15
00:02:06,426 --> 00:02:12,763
Trunk is tall and straight, branches cross horizontally.

16
00:02:15,478 --> 00:02:23,000
Small yellow-green leaves, slightly closed, look like withered leaves.

17
00:02:24,505 --> 00:02:34,280
But when fruit ripens, fragrance spreads, taste is sweet to obsession.

